# 37. NOT_FOUND / FOUND / MULTIPLE_RESULTS semantics

```text
NOT_FOUND
→ report candidates = ()

FOUND
→ report candidate 1件

MULTIPLE_RESULTS
→ 全 report candidate を calculation order で保持
```

ranking / preferred result / silent first-candidate selection は行わない。

